 "notes": "Kept all planned kinds; added Step sequencer (new, sourced to Music sequencer article). Removed duplicate P-6 (two entries -> Roland P-6). Moved old models into archetype versions (TR-8S, Analog Rytm MKII, Syntakt, Volca Drum, Octatrack MKII, SP-404MKII, MPC Live III/XL/Sample). Kept unattached old models in m (Alesis SR-16, DrumBrute Impact, BMX, RD-78, Polyend Drums, TR-1000, P-6, Push 3 Standalone). Dropped duplicated ranges (Roland TR, Elektron Analog, Korg Volca, Akai MPC, Novation Circuit, Pocket Operator) now covered by archetypes. Left out: Behringer RD-78 as CR-78 version and RD-9 as 909 version (not confirmed on a retrieved page); TR-8S as 909 version (only 808 link attested); MPC Key 61, Digitone, Monomachine, Yamaha RS7000, Toraiz SP-16 (no time/space); step-sequencer archetypes beyond Moog 960 (no retrieved source). Akai Professional country left blank (Akai brand ownership complex)."
